    "created_at": "2016-02-05T16:47:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-05T16:47:45Z",
    "body": "@tkent-google, when you [moved the default style for &lt;dialog> to html.css](https://codereview.chromium.org/553353002), do you recall if you deliberately skipped the `@media screen and (max-width: 540px)` bit under discussion here?\n\nPerhaps I'm the only one who finds this odd? Say an author wants the breakpoint to be either 530px or 550px, it seems a bit tedious to cancel out the default style in this case, more so than for \"plain\" default style.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
