    "created_at": "2017-03-23T10:03:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-23T10:03:44Z",
    "body": "I think we should remove this, or alternatively make the default style good for small screens and use that style for everything. Having a breakpoint in the UA stylesheet is unexpected. In https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/4605 / https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2208 we forgot about this rule both for updating it in the spec and then writing tests in a small iframe assuming the style for \"big\" screens would apply.",
